  "goodToKnow": "Speien means to spit or spew, a literary or elevated word: Feuer speien (dragons), Lava speien (volcanoes), Gift und Galle speien (to rant furiously). It's irregular: spie, gespien. Der Wasserspeier is a gargoyle, as on Cologne Cathedral. Everyday German uses spucken (to spit) or, for vomiting, sich übergeben or kotzen (vulgar)."
